class_name SfxRecipes
## Dev-only: every sound effect of the game as an SfxSynth recipe, with its mix. generate_sfx.gd renders
## each to assets/audio/sfx/<id>.wav (all normalised to the same loudness first), build_sfx_library.gd
## writes the mix into data/audio/sfx_library.tres. To change a sound, edit it here and rerun both.
## Mix: volume_db (its place in the mix: UI quiet, frequent combat below the big moments), voices (at
## most this many at once), interval (s: no two closer than this), jitter (random pitch +-), world
## (true: heard from where it happens; false: UI and announcements, centred).

